␀␀␀␀restart_failed␀␀erase failed; rebooting anyway␀␀factory_reset_failed␀␀␀␀{"status":"factory_reset","rebooting":true}␀{"status":"rebooting"}␀␀esp32h21␀␀␀␀idf_version␀chip␀␀␀␀chip_revision␀␀␀cores␀␀␀hardware␀␀␀␀uptime_s␀␀␀␀min_free_heap␀␀␀free_internal␀␀␀min_internal_free␀␀␀reset_reason␀␀␀␀config_storage_reset␀␀␀␀schema_etag␀ui_storage␀␀ui␀␀cpu_mhz␀flash_bytes␀flash_physical_bytes␀␀␀␀flash_partitioned_bytes␀ram_internal_bytes␀␀ram_psram_bytes␀features␀␀␀␀bt-classic␀␀802.15.4␀␀␀␀embedded-flash␀␀embedded-psram␀␀board␀␀␀coprocessor␀host_version␀␀␀␀stale␀␀␀synced␀␀last_reset␀␀health_key␀␀min_free_heap_before␀␀␀␀min_internal_before␀largest_block_before␀␀␀␀uptime_before_s␀%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ␀␀/api/v1/system/ping␀/api/v1/system/info␀/api/v1/system/reboot␀␀␀/api/v1/system/factory-reset␀␀␀␀{"next":%u}␀after␀␀␀{"first":%u,"next":%u,"dropped":%u,"size":%u,"used":%u,"gap":%s,"from":%u,"lines":[␀level␀␀␀expected {"level": none|error|warn|info|debug|verbose[, "tag": "..."]}␀␀{"tag":"%s","level":"%s"}␀␀␀/api/v1/logs␀␀␀␀/api/v1/logs/level␀␀erase_failed␀␀␀␀I (%lu) %s: core dump erased
